   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h1>SASS Grids: Homework Notebook</h1>\n",
    "<p><strong>Lesson:</strong> OCS Grid Grammar (SASS Grids)\n",
    "<strong>Contents:</strong> Popcorn Hacks 1-2, MCQ result, Homework Hack (two grids built only with OCS classes), submission notes.</p>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Popcorn Hack 1: Fix the Beaker Row</h2>\n",
    "<p>Replaced the inline <code>style</code> and the made-up <code>box</code> class with one <code>ocs__grid</code>, one <code>ocs__grid--standard</code> variant, and an <code>ocs__grid-cell</code> on each of the three beakers.</p>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Grids Popcorn 1 -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__grid ocs__grid--standard\">\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker A: Water</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker B: Salt Water</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker C: Vinegar</div>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Popcorn Hack 2: Size the Beakers with <code>fr</code></h2>\n",
    "<p>Four boxes in one row means <strong>four</strong> <code>fr</code> values. The Control Beaker is last and should be twice as wide as each of the others, so the values are <code>1fr 1fr 1fr 2fr</code>.</p>\n",
    "<p><strong>fr values used:</strong> <code>1fr 1fr 1fr 2fr</code></p>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Grids Popcorn 2 -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__grid ocs__grid--standard\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 2fr;\">\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker 1</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker 2</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker 3</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Control Beaker</div>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>MCQ Check</h2>\n",
    "<table>\n",
    "<thead>\n",
    "<tr>\n",
    "  <th>#</th>\n",
    "  <th>Question</th>\n",
    "  <th>My answer</th>\n",
    "  <th>Why</th>\n",
    "</tr>\n",
    "</thead>\n",
    "<tbody>\n",
    "<tr>\n",
    "  <td>1</td>\n",
    "  <td>Make a standard grid show 4 boxes per row</td>\n",
    "  <td><strong>A</strong> (<code>cols-4</code>)</td>\n",
    "  <td>Same as <code>1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr</code>.</td>\n",
    "</tr>\n",
    "<tr>\n",
    "  <td>2</td>\n",
    "  <td><code>grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr</code></td>\n",
    "  <td><strong>B</strong> (2 boxes, first twice as wide)</td>\n",
    "  <td>Two values = two boxes; 2 of 3 shares vs. 1 of 3.</td>\n",
    "</tr>\n",
    "<tr>\n",
    "  <td>3</td>\n",
    "  <td>Cell type that stretches across the whole row</td>\n",
    "  <td><strong>C</strong> (<code>ocs__grid-cell--header</code>)</td>\n",
    "  <td><code>--header</code> spans every column; <code>--wide</code> only spans 2.</td>\n",
    "</tr>\n",
    "<tr>\n",
    "  <td>4</td>\n",
    "  <td>Line that breaks the rule</td>\n",
    "  <td><strong>D</strong> (<code>class=&quot;my-row&quot; style=&quot;display:flex&quot;</code>)</td>\n",
    "  <td>Made-up class plus an inline style.</td>\n",
    "</tr>\n",
    "</tbody>\n",
    "</table>\n",
    "<pre><code class=\"language-text\">MCQ Grids: 4/4 | answers: A,B,C,D\n",
    "</code></pre>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Homework Hack</h2>\n",
    "<p>Fixed both grids using only OCS classes:</p>\n",
    "<ul>\n",
    "<li><strong>Grid 1:</strong> <code>ocs__grid ocs__grid--standard</code>. The title is a <code>--header</code> cell and Beaker 3 (the outlier at 31.6) is an <code>--accent</code> cell.</li>\n",
    "<li><strong>Grid 2:</strong> <code>ocs__grid ocs__grid--calculator</code>, a keypad. The <code>Avg</code> key is an <code>--accent</code> cell.</li>\n",
    "<li>Every box is an <code>ocs__grid-cell</code>, and there are no <code>style</code> attributes and no made-up classes (<code>my-row</code>, <code>title-box</code>, <code>sample-card</code>, <code>highlight</code>, <code>key</code>, <code>orange</code> are all gone).</li>\n",
    "</ul>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "grid-hw-8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Grids Homework -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__grid ocs__grid--standard\">\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell ocs__grid-cell--header\">Temperature Trial (°C)</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker 1: 22.4</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">Beaker 2: 22.9</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell ocs__grid-cell--accent\">Beaker 3: 31.6</div>\n",
    "</div>\n",
    "\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__grid ocs__grid--calculator\">\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">7</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">8</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell\">9</div>\n",
    "  <div class=\"ocs__grid-cell ocs__grid-cell--accent\">Avg</div>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
